{
  "title": "About SVG Plugin",
  "plugin": "svg",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "6c94ed71d7ecae80",
      "text": "Safe SVG capsule viewer for Federated Wiki. Sanitises incoming SVG, scales it to the 420px column, expands to fullscreen on click, and dispatches `data-fedwiki-action` attributes as wiki navigation — the display layer of the [[Visual Plugin Family]]."
    },
    {
      "type": "svg",
      "id": "c662201de90ab102",
      "text": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 120\">\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#4a9eff\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n  <text x=\"65\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\">Authoring Plugin</text>\n  <rect x=\"145\" y=\"10\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#4aaa55\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\">Render Broker</text>\n  <rect x=\"280\" y=\"10\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e07b39\" opacity=\"0.85\"\n    data-fedwiki-action=\"open-page\" data-fedwiki-page=\"SVG Capsules\"/>\n  <text x=\"335\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\"\n    data-fedwiki-action=\"open-page\" data-fedwiki-page=\"SVG Capsules\">SVG Capsule ↗</text>\n  <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"255\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr)\"/>\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arr\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#555\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\">Click the orange node to open SVG Capsules · Click background to expand fullscreen</text>\n</svg>"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "92b98de352e53169",
      "text": "## Safety"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "8f21e4663b63020a",
      "text": "The plugin sanitises every SVG before rendering. It strips `<script>`, `<foreignObject>`, and inline event handlers (`onclick`, `onmouseover`, etc.). Remote `href` and `xlink:href` on `<use>`, `<image>`, and `<feImage>` are removed. The SVG declares affordances; the plugin interprets them — no code runs inside the SVG itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "8285188ebe7b3205",
      "text": "## Wiki Affordances"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "9fdf1fe7e39cef01",
      "text": "SVG elements carrying `data-fedwiki-action=\"open-page\"` open a wiki page when clicked. Optionally specify a remote site with `data-fedwiki-site`."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "d39b342be3c867bf",
      "text": "<g\n  data-fedwiki-action=\"open-page\"\n  data-fedwiki-page=\"SVG Capsules\"\n  data-fedwiki-site=\"kroki.localhost\">\n  <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"40\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e07b39\"/>\n  <text x=\"74\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\">SVG Capsules</text>\n</g>",
      "language": "xml"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "5b86fd19886f6bb4",
      "text": "## Scaling and Fullscreen"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "aad58c2982a7131e",
      "text": "The SVG is scaled to fit the 420px wiki column with `width:100%`. Clicking anywhere that is not a wiki affordance opens a fullscreen dark overlay. Press `Escape` or click to close."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "01d6f2e287644b0c",
      "text": "## Repositories"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "f6f81f3aad56b5ad",
      "text": "- [GitHub — wiki-plugin-svg](https://github.com/Hitchhikers-Guide-to-the-Galaxy/wiki-plugin-svg)\n- [npm — wiki-plugin-svg](https://www.npmjs.com/package/wiki-plugin-svg)"
    }
  ],
